    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72646" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶσος</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
			Ael.Dion.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			76
		</span></i>) or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰσός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>withy, Vitex Agnus-castus,</i> the twigs of which served
			for wickerwork, ropes, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.18.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.2.2
			</span></i>, etc.: neut. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶσον</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοινίον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: perh. cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖσον.</span></div>
